{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Classification keys and living things","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f1","foreground":"#1d3b1f","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c1-p","picto":"leaf"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Which group does a leaf belong to: living or non-living?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Living","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Non-living","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Neither, it is a plant part","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Classification key"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"A list of yes-or-no questions that helps you name a living thing by following its features step by step."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c3-p","picto":"fish"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"A fish has fins and lives in water. What group is it in?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Animals","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Plants","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Fungi","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"In a classification key, what do you do at each step?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Answer a yes-or-no question about the feature","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Guess the name from its colour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Count how many legs it has only","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c5-p","picto":"map"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You find a small creature in the school garden. Do you go inside to ask a teacher or use your key first?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Use the key first","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Ask a teacher first","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You follow the key step by step and find it is a woodlouse. Well done, you named it yourself!"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Your teacher smiles and shows you the key. Together you find it is a woodlouse."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c8-p","picto":"tree"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Which of these is a plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Oak tree","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Mushroom","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Earthworm","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Habitat"},{"type":"text","id":"c9-e","content":"The place where a living thing lives and finds food, water and shelter."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Which feature would you check first in a classification key for a bird?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Does it have feathers?","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"What colour is the sky?","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"How tall is the nearest tree?","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done, you finished the classification keys stack!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"You can now explore and use keys to group, identify and name living things around you."}],"actions":[]}}
